<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#111214"><title>Godscar | Combat</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/lab/combat/styles.css"></head>
<body><main class="app">
<header class="top"><a href="/lab/combat/" class="brand"><b>G</b> GODSCAR</a><span class="preview">SCREEN PREVIEW</span><button id="customize" aria-label="Customize layout">☷</button><button id="effects" aria-label="Reduce effects">✦</button></header>
<aside id="layout" class="layout" hidden><div class="row"><div><small>SCREEN SETUP</small><h2>Arrange the fight screen</h2></div><button id="closeLayout">×</button></div><p>Move or hide whole panels. Combat stays visible. Preferences stay in this browser.</p><div id="layoutRows"></div><div class="row"><button id="restore">Restore hidden panels</button><button id="reset">Reset layout</button></div></aside>
<section class="panel block" data-panel="character"><div class="hero"><div class="sigil">✦</div><div><small>PALADIN · LEVEL 18</small><h1>Veyra of the Ashen Road</h1></div><span class="char-link">Character ↗</span></div><div class="bar-label"><small>VITALITY</small><b id="healthText">1,840 / 1,840</b></div><div class="bar"><i id="playerHealth"></i></div></section>
<section class="panel weapon block" data-panel="weapon"><div class="weapon-icon">⚒</div><div class="weapon-copy"><small>RARE · MACE + SHIELD</small><b>Oathkeeper's Mace</b><small>Mace swing · 1.8 sec · 86–124 physical</small></div><span class="ready"><i></i>AUTO<br>READY</span></section>
<section class="panel block" data-panel="spells"><div class="row"><small>AUTOMATED INSCRIPTIONS · 2 ACTIVE</small><button>Manage ↗</button></div><div class="spells"><div class="spell fire"><b>✹</b><span><strong>Ember Brand</strong><small>Fire · damage over time</small></span><em>2.4<small>sec</small></em></div><div class="spell poison"><b>⌁</b><span><strong>Venom Mark</strong><small>Poison · damage over time</small></span><em>5.1<small>sec</small></em></div></div></section>
<section class="fight block" data-panel="combat"><div class="row"><div><small>CURRENT HUNT</small><h2>Gallowsfen · The Sunken Road</h2></div><span class="live"><i></i> FIGHTING</span></div><div class="row sub"><span>WAVE <b id="wave">08</b></span><span>ELITE <b>BLIGHTED</b></span><button>Change hunt ›</button></div>
<div class="stage" id="stage"><div class="shade"></div><div class="badge">LV. 21 <span>BLIGHTED · BEAST</span></div><div class="monster-name"><b id="monsterName">Gravejaw Stalker</b><small>Scavenger swollen with grave-mold</small></div>
<svg class="beast" viewBox="0 0 240 220" role="img" aria-label="Placeholder silhouette of a blighted beast"><defs><linearGradient id="skin" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#b2a989"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#697367"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#303a37"/></linearGradient></defs><ellipse cx="120" cy="201" rx="78" ry="10" fill="#090c0ccc"/><g fill="url(#skin)" stroke="#252c2a" stroke-width="5" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M73 163c-9-17-16-38-9-57 5-17 22-31 43-35l-3-25 20 17 23-5 7-27 18 24 18 9 21-16-7 31c8 14 12 28 8 45l-8 34 15 20-33 5-13-13-43 1-15 16-37-6z"/><path d="M74 88 48 66l13 38m102-39 31-28-4 42M93 161l-13 27-18 8 5-30m80-5 17 25 21 5-12-30"/></g><path d="M91 108q12-12 24 0m25-1q13-12 25 1" fill="none" stroke="#e7b76d" stroke-width="5"/><circle cx="105" cy="108" r="3.5" fill="#ffc96f"/><circle cx="153" cy="108" r="3.5" fill="#ffc96f"/></svg><div id="hits" class="hits"></div><div class="statuses"><span>⌁ BLEEDING</span><span>❄ SLOWED</span></div><div class="monster-hp"><div class="bar-label"><small>GRAVEJAW STALKER</small><b id="monsterText">3,942 / 8,200</b></div><div class="bar red"><i id="monsterHealth"></i></div></div><div class="stage-foot"><span>◆ 1,248 kills</span><span>◈ 0 deaths</span><span id="stageDps">2.4K DPS</span></div></div>
<div class="row event-head"><small>RECENT HITS</small><span><i></i> LIVE FEED</span></div><div id="events" class="events"></div></section>
<section class="block" data-panel="summary"><div class="panel dps"><div><small>SESSION DAMAGE</small><strong><span id="dps">0</span> <em>DPS</em></strong></div><button id="openDps">Damage breakdown <b>↗</b></button></div><div class="stats"><div><small>✦ EXPERIENCE</small><b id="xp">+12,640</b></div><div><small>◆ MATERIALS</small><b id="mats">+18 Grave Dust</b></div><div><small>☠ MONSTERS SLAIN</small><b id="kills">1,248</b></div></div><p class="sample">Illustrative screen data. This page animates sample combat and does not alter a game save.</p></section>
<section class="panel more block" data-panel="systems"><div><small>NEXT STOP</small><b>Gear, inventory & builds</b><p>Review your items while the fight keeps moving.</p></div><a href="/lab/arsenal/">Open systems preview ↗</a></section>
<footer>GODSCAR · COMBAT SCREEN CONCEPT <span>● PREVIEW ONLY</span></footer></main>
<dialog id="offline" class="modal"><div class="modal-inner"><small>WHILE YOU WERE AWAY</small><div class="moon">☾</div><h2>The hunt continued.</h2><p>Your champion kept fighting while you were gone.</p><div class="away"><span>AWAY FOR</span><b>2h 14m</b></div><div class="rewards"><div>✦<small>EXPERIENCE</small><b>+18,420</b></div><div>◆<small>MATERIALS</small><b>+26</b></div><div>☠<small>MONSTERS</small><b>+84</b></div></div><button id="continue" class="primary">Return to the fight</button><small class="hint">Tap outside to close</small></div></dialog>
<dialog id="damageModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-inner"><div class="row"><div><small>DAMAGE SINCE RESET</small><h2>Session breakdown</h2></div><button id="closeDps">×</button></div><p>Each attack and damage-over-time tick is counted by its source. Totals remain until you reset them.</p><div class="total">Total damage <b id="total">0</b></div><div id="damageRows" class="damage-rows"></div><div class="row"><button id="resetDps">Reset session damage</button><button id="done" class="primary">Done</button></div></div></dialog>
<script type="module" src="/lab/combat/main.mjs"></script></body></html>